{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone needs your help, but you don't have enough time to save her. Leap into the past to succeed, but don't trigger a time paradox. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Riggers is a turn-based time-leap puzzle game that will challenge your spatio-temporal logic and memory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135920/extras/56e7c0b77771e96382897f687a35fb4d.poster.avif?t=1773245850\" width=320 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135920/extras/56e7c0b77771e96382897f687a35fb4d.webm?t=1773245850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135920/extras/56e7c0b77771e96382897f687a35fb4d.mp4?t=1773245850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Goal </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate the switches and reach the exit before the time is up. Each move costs 1 second. The time limit is indicated by the watch. Leap into to past to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to leap into the past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use your Time-Pack  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135920/extras/06c6bfa9ee2b6181245e88c5f0090083.apng?t=1773245850\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135920/extras/06c6bfa9ee2b6181245e88c5f0090083.poster.avif?t=1773245850\" class=\"bb_img\" width=28 height=28 /></picture></span>. When you do so, you will see your past self.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't run into your past self, that would trigger a time paradox.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each leap in the past costs some energy. The amount of energy left is indicated with the gauge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 23 puzzles :  13 easy, 6 medium, 4 difficult puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 scoring levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Includes 1 hour in gameplay.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Time-Pack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135920/ecd979bdb1711d11d9b0311ff18995319ef6671f.jpg"},{"name":"Mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135920/229f90c7a3787a9a04cd8af11f5f12580ab7ee45.jpg"},{"name":"Warehouse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135920/303d7b44c99bbb9841d65b045f0571d9a3e8bcd2.jpg"},{"name":"Pyramid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135920/62c992858d9d9ed74f36aab734b354f6b76ee643.jpg"},{"name":"Water Tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135920/aba6a89e414aed8302b4b7ab636ae8a7fc264ced.jpg"},{"name":"Museum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135920/49cced4f2da79216870355c8ff59bbcf9b20d571.jpg"},{"name":"Electrical Transformer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135920/cee9e1a7816ed389eb07998ad52e663002e35d8f.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3135920?t=1773245850","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3135920?t=1773245850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135920/227107cffe5348bd00ec9b8f92013ec8